.DS_Store
# KB data committed by choice (2026-06-08): markdown_docs(source), parent_store + qdrant_db
# (regenerable via `python project/reindex.py` — committed for clone-and-run convenience).
backups/
docs/*
!docs/observability/
!docs/debugging/
__pycache__/
.vscode/
.env
.venv/
venv/

# machine-specific CA bundle (Windows trust store export, for TLS-scanning AV)
win-ca-bundle.pem

# 계정 DB + 토큰 서명키 — 개인정보/시크릿이므로 절대 커밋하지 않는다.
# (스키마는 project/db/user_db.py의 init_db()가 기동 시 만든다)
data/users.db
data/users.db-wal
data/users.db-shm
data/.user_token.key

# frontend build artifacts / local env
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.next/
frontend/.env.local

# node deps anywhere + Qdrant runtime lock (regenerated on run)
node_modules/
qdrant_db/.lock
# Word/Office temp lock files
~$*

# KPI eval tool: per-run reports/dumps are ephemeral (gitignored). The carve-out
# is deliberate — eval_tools/baselines/ and eval_tools/data/ stay TRACKED
# (regression refs + committed test set); only runs/ is ignored.
eval_tools/runs/

# Eval-run outputs (per-run JSON/logs — ephemeral, rebuild from _qa_blend_sweep.sh)
logs/h2eval/
# App log daily rotations (TimedRotatingFileHandler date-suffixed backups)
logs/backend/app.log.*

# test / lint / type-check tooling artifacts (CI-generated, never committed)
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
